<title>USA: TABLE-Farr Q2 shr rises to $0.32 from $0.27.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Farr Q2 shr rises to $0.32 from $0.27.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>FARR CO AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>			COMPARATIVE STATEMENTS OF INCOME</p>
<p>		  (000's omitted, except per share items)</p>
<p>				 UNAUDITED</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				   Jun 28     Jun 29   Jun 28  Jun 29</p>
<p>				     1997	 1996     1997    1996</p>
<p> Net Sales		    $31,569    $31,356  $61,910 $62,435</p>
<p> Gross margin		   8,576	8,072   16,467  15,226</p>
<p> Net Income		     1,826	l,499    3,526   2,677</p>
<p> Earnings Per Common Share*  0.32	 0.27     0.62    0.48</p>
<p>* Based upon 5,632,922 and 5,509,545 average shares outstanding in 1997 and 1996, respectively.  Per share amounts have been adjusted to reflect the 3-for-2 stock split effected in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend which was paid March 28 to shareholders of record March 7.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 603-3310))</p>
